recommend check-in (Keaton) -- one tree per star, or a lock in bridge_to_zig: %281's answer is still the crux and two sessions just proved it twice in one hour. The shelf stamp two hours behind the clock wants an erratum, his word. Sound's next lap is core-first: Caravan and Tally green on this bench, the choir whole.
